# Source corpus — the master regulatory PDFs (data/master_pdfs/, ~18MB).
#
# They are build-time input to pipeline/extract_forms_from_master_pdfs.py and are
# never read by the running application, so they do not belong in the repo. Keep
# them on disk; the extractor exits non-zero with instructions if they are absent.
#
# A pattern with no slash matches at any depth, so this covers data/master_pdfs/
# as well as the repo root.
*.pdf
